{
  "$schema": "nexus-agent/spec-contract/v1",
  "spec": "p4",
  "specRef": "docs/specs/p4/spec.md",
  "phase": "P4",
  "crate": "nexus-agent",
  "$comment": [
    "P4 的不变量契约。",
    "",
    "status 语义（scripts/check-specs.sh 规则 3）：",
    "  verified —— 该不变量**已有**证据；verified_by 指向的测试必须**真的存在**。",
    "  planned —— 该不变量已**声明**，证据将在对应 Task 落地时产生；",
    "              此时 verified_by 指向的测试文件可能还不存在。",
    "",
    "「planned 不等于可以糊弄」：规则 3b 会在该 Spec 的**全部任务都归档**后",
    "要求所有 planned 提升为 verified —— 届时测试必须存在，否则门禁红。",
    "",
    "这解决了 S2 必须先于 S4 的顺序问题：Spec 在实现之前落盘，",
    "契约声明**先于**证据产生，但证据缺失时门禁**不会**因此被绕过。"
  ],
  "error_codes": {
    "$comment": "P4 复用的 nexus-core 已定稿业务码 —— 不得新增，不得改值。",
    "source": "crates/nexus-core/src/error.rs",
    "allowed": [
      {
        "code": 30002,
        "variant": "MaxIteration",
        "http": 500,
        "retry": "Terminal",
        "p4_use": "超出迭代上限"
      },
      {
        "code": 30006,
        "variant": "BudgetExceeded",
        "http": 500,
        "retry": "Terminal",
        "p4_use": "裁剪后仍超预算"
      },
      {
        "code": 10001,
        "variant": "InvalidParam",
        "http": 400,
        "retry": "Terminal",
        "p4_use": "工具调用协议非法（ID 缺失/重复/配对断裂）"
      },
      {
        "code": 70001,
        "variant": "ToolNotFound",
        "http": 404,
        "retry": "Terminal",
        "p4_use": "工具不存在"
      },
      {
        "code": 70002,
        "variant": "ToolFailed",
        "http": 500,
        "retry": "UnknownOutcome",
        "p4_use": "工具执行失败（结构化回灌）"
      },
      {
        "code": 70003,
        "variant": "ToolTimeout",
        "http": 504,
        "retry": "UnknownOutcome",
        "p4_use": "工具执行超时"
      },
      {
        "code": 50001,
        "variant": "ModelUnavailable",
        "http": 502,
        "retry": "Retryable",
        "p4_use": "模型调用失败"
      },
      {
        "code": 50002,
        "variant": "ModelTimeout",
        "http": 504,
        "retry": "UnknownOutcome",
        "p4_use": "单步/总超时"
      },
      {
        "code": 90001,
        "variant": "Internal",
        "http": 500,
        "retry": "Terminal",
        "p4_use": "内部状态不一致"
      },
      {
        "code": 90003,
        "variant": "ServiceUnavailable",
        "http": 503,
        "retry": "Retryable",
        "p4_use": "运行被取消"
      }
    ]
  },
  "invariants": [
    {
      "id": "P4-I01",
      "statement": "协议完整性：孤立的 tool_result（无对应 tool_call）被拒绝，返回 InvalidParam",
      "layer": "behavior",
      "verified_by": [
        "crates/nexus-agent/src/protocol.rs::an_unpaired_tool_result_is_rejected"
      ],
      "status": "verified"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-I02",
      "statement": "协议完整性：缺失 tool_result（tool_call 没有对应结果）被拒绝",
      "layer": "behavior",
      "verified_by": [
        "crates/nexus-agent/src/protocol.rs::a_missing_tool_result_is_rejected"
      ],
      "status": "verified"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-I03",
      "statement": "协议完整性：重复的 tool_call ID 被拒绝",
      "layer": "behavior",
      "verified_by": [
        "crates/nexus-agent/src/protocol.rs::a_duplicate_tool_call_id_is_rejected"
      ],
      "status": "verified"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-I04",
      "statement": "协议完整性校验先于裁剪 —— 配对断裂时即使超预算，报的也是配对错误而非预算错误",
      "layer": "behavior",
      "$comment": "NEX-26 交付时，测试落在 protocol.rs —— 因为那时 compaction.rs 还不存在。NEX-27 落地裁剪后，这条不变量的**完整**形态（真实裁剪路径）由 compaction.rs 的测试承担。",
      "verified_by": [
        "crates/nexus-agent/src/protocol.rs::the_pairing_check_runs_before_the_budget_check"
      ],
      "status": "verified"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-I05",
      "statement": "整轮淘汰保留所有 system 消息",
      "layer": "behavior",
      "verified_by": [
        "crates/nexus-agent/src/compaction.rs::all_system_messages_are_retained"
      ],
      "status": "planned"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-I06",
      "statement": "整轮淘汰保留最新一轮 user 消息",
      "layer": "behavior",
      "verified_by": [
        "crates/nexus-agent/src/compaction.rs::the_latest_user_turn_is_retained"
      ],
      "status": "planned"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-I07",
      "statement": "整轮淘汰按**整轮**删除 —— 该轮的所有并行工具结果一起被删，不留孤立 tool_result",
      "layer": "behavior",
      "verified_by": [
        "crates/nexus-agent/src/compaction.rs::a_whole_turn_is_evicted_with_its_parallel_tool_results"
      ],
      "status": "planned"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-I08",
      "statement": "裁剪不生成摘要 —— 保留的消息是原样，未新增任何摘要消息",
      "layer": "behavior",
      "verified_by": [
        "crates/nexus-agent/src/compaction.rs::no_summary_message_is_generated"
      ],
      "status": "planned"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-I09",
      "statement": "裁剪是纯函数 —— 入参未被修改，同输入同输出",
      "layer": "behavior",
      "verified_by": [
        "crates/nexus-agent/src/compaction.rs::compaction_is_pure",
        "crates/nexus-agent/src/compaction.rs::compaction_does_not_mutate_the_input"
      ],
      "status": "planned"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-I10",
      "statement": "裁剪的双向边界都被测试：恰好在预算内通过，超出即返回 BudgetExceeded",
      "layer": "behavior",
      "verified_by": [
        "crates/nexus-agent/src/compaction.rs::a_history_that_exactly_fits_is_accepted",
        "crates/nexus-agent/src/compaction.rs::an_oversized_history_is_rejected"
      ],
      "status": "planned"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-I11",
      "statement": "ReAct 循环跑通至少两轮：模型要求工具 → 工具执行 → 结果回灌 → 模型给出最终答案",
      "layer": "behavior",
      "verified_by": [
        "crates/nexus-agent/tests/react_loop.rs::the_loop_runs_a_tool_turn_and_then_answers"
      ],
      "status": "planned"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-I12",
      "statement": "迭代上限生效：超出 max_iterations 时以 MaxIteration（30002）终止",
      "layer": "behavior",
      "verified_by": [
        "crates/nexus-agent/tests/react_loop.rs::the_iteration_limit_stops_the_loop_with_max_iteration"
      ],
      "status": "planned"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-I13",
      "statement": "单步超时生效：单次模型调用超时以 ModelTimeout（50002）终止",
      "layer": "behavior",
      "verified_by": [
        "crates/nexus-agent/tests/react_loop.rs::the_per_step_timeout_stops_the_loop"
      ],
      "status": "planned"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-I14",
      "statement": "总超时生效：整个运行超时以 ModelTimeout（50002）终止",
      "layer": "behavior",
      "verified_by": [
        "crates/nexus-agent/tests/react_loop.rs::the_overall_timeout_stops_the_loop"
      ],
      "status": "planned"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-I15",
      "statement": "工具失败**结构化回灌**且**不终止**循环 —— 错误作为 tool 角色消息回灌，模型仍能给出答案",
      "layer": "behavior",
      "verified_by": [
        "crates/nexus-agent/tests/react_loop.rs::a_failing_tool_is_reported_back_to_the_model_without_stopping_the_loop"
      ],
      "status": "planned"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-I16",
      "statement": "工具输出是**数据**不是指令 —— 回灌时是 tool 角色消息，不是 assistant 消息",
      "layer": "behavior",
      "verified_by": [
        "crates/nexus-agent/tests/react_loop.rs::tool_output_is_replayed_as_a_tool_message_not_an_assistant_message"
      ],
      "status": "planned"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-I17",
      "statement": "工具并发限流生效 —— 同一轮内同时执行的工具数不超过上限",
      "layer": "behavior",
      "verified_by": [
        "crates/nexus-agent/tests/react_loop.rs::the_tool_concurrency_limit_is_enforced"
      ],
      "status": "planned"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-I18",
      "statement": "事件序号严格单调、无重复、无空洞（并发工具调用下）",
      "layer": "behavior",
      "verified_by": [
        "crates/nexus-agent/tests/events.rs::the_event_sequence_is_strictly_monotonic_under_concurrent_tool_calls"
