      "status": "planned"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-I19",
      "statement": "终态事件**必达**、增量**可丢** —— 填满增量通道后终态仍然送达",
      "layer": "behavior",
      "verified_by": [
        "crates/nexus-agent/tests/events.rs::the_terminal_event_is_delivered_when_the_lossy_channel_is_full"
      ],
      "status": "planned"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-I20",
      "statement": "背压超时**主动取消**整个运行，而不是无限阻塞",
      "layer": "behavior",
      "verified_by": [
        "crates/nexus-agent/tests/events.rs::backpressure_cancels_the_run_instead_of_blocking_forever"
