      "statement": "先固化错误再取消 —— 供应商失败不会被 cancel 覆盖成「用户取消」",
      "layer": "behavior",
      "verified_by": [
        "crates/nexus-agent/tests/react_loop.rs::the_original_error_is_preserved_before_cancelling"
      ],
      "status": "planned"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4-I23",
